  "name": "Incentive Compensation Payslip Advisor DSCUST",
  "description": "This agent team automates the generation and delivery of incentive compensation participant payslips. It integrates with Oracle Incentive Compensation to identify the participant and retrieve their PersonNumber, connects with Oracle HCM to resolve the corresponding PersonId, and then accesses HCM Payroll services to fetch and deliver the participant’s payslip document. The team ensures secure, accurate, and seamless access to compensation-related payslips for HR, Payroll administrators, and employees.",
